## createCommandsDictionary (body-1)

Builds a lazy dictionary for a descriptor, optionally obtaining its watcher, and creates the instantiated-command Set. Binds destroy to dictionary, registers descriptor-destroyed listener, and installs lazy getters for all module names.

- reads: descriptor traits/client; enableWindowGlobalThreadActors; Commands map
- writes: Dictionary, command Set, descriptor listener, lazy properties
- branches: Watcher is fetched only when descriptor trait allows it.
- result: Promise resolving to command dictionary.
- errors: Watcher/loader failures reject; no local cleanup on failed construction.
- async: Awaits getWatcher before dictionary creation.
- ownership: Dictionary owns commands; descriptor event triggers dictionary cleanup.

